#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioActivationClassic)
#. +> trunk stable
#: ui/LancelotConfigBase.ui:46
msgid "Choose this option if you want the menu to behave like the standard application launchers. In order to launch applications, you should click on them. Section buttons are activated by hovering."
